499 0 obj<</Subj(Text Box)/Type/Annot/P 5 0 R/F 4/C[]/CreationDate(D:20251201174228-08'00')/T(Ahed Saleh)/Subtype/FreeText/BS<</W 3/S/S/Type/Border>>/DA(0 0 0 rg /Helv 16 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica 16pt; text-align:left; margin:10pt; line-height:20.24pt; color:#000000)/M(D:20260120155610-08'00')/AP<</N 501 0 R>>/Rect[988.8171 12.53455 1932.253 1570.288]/NM(JAGAMLLPJKLSGAIL)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" style="font:Helvetica 16pt; text-align:left; margin:10pt; line-height:20.24pt; color:#000000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:30.36pt; font-size:24pt; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline; text-align:center">SECTION \(2\)-FOR REVISION SUBMITTALS ONLY</span></p><p style="text-align:center; line-height:30.36pt; font-size:24pt; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline" /><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:30.36pt; font-size:24pt; font-weight:bold; text-align:center">All items listed below must be checked and provided during the revision  submittal. </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt">A complete set of revised plans must be provided to our office. Revision submittals that lack any of the items listed below, as applicable, will be deemed incomplete and will not be placed in the queue for review. See Section \(1\) for clarification on what constitutes a complete set of plans. Please note that any plans submitted after approval will be subject to the applicable hourly fee.</p><p style="color:#000000; line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt" /><p style="color:#000000; line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt">A complete revision submittal would typically include the items listed below. Please verify that you have submitted: </span></p><p style="color:#000000; line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">      </span><span style="line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt"><span style="text-decoration:underline; font-weight:bold; line-height:20.24pt">Response Letter or Correspondence</span><span style="line-height:20.24pt"> </span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">       </span><span style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt">\200 Clearly identifies </span><span style="font-weight:bold; line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt">each correction </span><span style="font-weight:normal; line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt">made. </span></span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">       </span><span style="line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200 Specifies the </span><span style="font-weight:bold; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">location </span><span style="font-weight:normal; line-height:20.24pt">of each correction on the revised plans \(e.g. sheet number, detail number\). </span></span></span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">       \200 Written operational statement, if applicable. </span></p><p style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt">      </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">      </span><span style="font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">Complete Set of Revised Plans \(</span><span style="font-style:italic; line-height:20.24pt">see Section 1</span><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\) </span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">       </span><span style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt">\200 Submit the entire collated plan set, not just individual revised sheets. </span></p><p style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">       </span><span style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt">\200 Ensure all sheets are updated and consistent. </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">       \200 For best practices and to aid in a speedy review ensure all changes are clouded for ease of reference. </span></p><p style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt">      </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">       </span><span style="font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline; line-height:20.24pt">Certification Statement </span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">       </span><span style="font-weight:bold; line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt">\200 </span><span style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt">Section \(2\) is read and signed. </span></p><p style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt" /><p style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt"><span style="color:#FF0000">Revision submittals are screened by our office, and incomplete sets will not be placed in the review queue. Due to the large volume of revisions received, not every resubmittal can be thoroughly reviewed for completeness during initial screening. If a revision is placed in the queue and the plan checker later determines that the resubmittal is incomplete, the submitter will be notified that the review cannot be completed. Because the project occupied time in the queue before being deemed incomplete, this may result in delays. It is the sole responsibility of the submitter to ensure that all required corrections and documents are included before resubmitting. Our office is not responsible for any lost time caused by incomplete resubmittals.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.24pt; font-size:16pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline; line-height:20.24pt">Types of Revision Submittals: Resubmittals or Change of Scope</span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline" /><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none; line-height:20.24pt">Resubmittals</span><span style="line-height:20.24pt">: Plans submitted with only changes directly linked to comments or corrections issued by this department. </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">Examples of Resubmittals:</span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Relocating or resizing a sink, floor sink, or floor drain per correction comments </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Changing finish materials that were previously unapproved </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Adding missing compliance details \(e.g., cove base, backsplash height, floor slope\) </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Providing missing equipment data sheets or sanitation listings </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Correcting labeling errors on plan sheets </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Adjusting lighting or ventilation details as requested </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Revising plumbing or electrical layouts solely to address issued corrections </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="font-weight:bold; line-height:20.24pt">Change of Scope</span><span style="line-height:20.24pt">: Plans submitted with changes outside the scope of the issued correction letter or with a change to the scope of work or operations. </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">Examples of Change of Scope:</span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Adding new rooms, bars, or food prep areas not previously shown </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Changing type or location of major equipment \(e.g., new hood, walk-in cooler\) </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Expanding plumbing or electrical systems beyond prior corrections </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Modifying construction scope \(e.g., converting dry storage to food prep\) </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Introducing operational changes that affect classification \(e.g., pre-packaged to open food handling\) </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Adding equipment requiring referral to other agencies \(CDFA, FDA, USDA\) </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Submitting partial plans that conflict with prior submittals </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Changing contractor notes, installation methods, or ceiling/floor systems not previously reviewed</span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt">\200Substantial changes to the floor plan layout. </span></p><p style="font-size:16pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt"><span><span><span><span><span><span> </span><span style="font-weight:bold"> This submittal is:                                 Resubmittal                                            Change of Scope                   </span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt"><span style="line-height:20.24pt"><span style="font-weight:bold; text-align:center; line-height:20.24pt">Our plan check team will complete all resubmittals within 10 business days. However, plans with "change of scope" will be reviewed within 20 business days. </span></span></p><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt" /><p style="font-size:16pt; line-height:20.24pt" /></body>)/Contents<>>>
endobj
