758 0 obj<</Subj(Text Box)/Type/Annot/P 5 0 R/F 4/C[]/CreationDate(D:20251203131039-08'00')/T(Ahed Saleh)/Subtype/FreeText/BS<</W 0/S/S/Type/Border>>/DA(1 0 0 rg /Helv 14 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica 14pt; text-align:left; margin:3pt; line-height:20.93pt; color:#000000)/M(D:20260105095644-08'00')/AP<</N 760 0 R>>/Rect[61.27106 311.6293 796.2645 1254.549]/NM(RKBOPZAPUWYLXHPM)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" style="font:Helvetica 14pt; text-align:left; margin:3pt; line-height:20.93pt; color:#000000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(1\) Cover Sheet </p><p style="font-size:14pt"> \200Must be collated with the plans and submitted as the first page. </p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Completed with Section \(1\) or Section \(2\) \(whichever applies\).</span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Includes Project Information and Scope of Work.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(2\) </span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Scaled Plans</span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200All plans drawn to scale \(e.g., \274" = 1', \275" = 1', or equivalent\).</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Includes drawn details and elevation drawings.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(3\) </span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Facility Identification</span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200</span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Facility name and address on all sheets \(must be consistent\).</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(4\) Site Plan                                                                                                                                                                       </span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200</span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Shows facility location and refuse area.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(5\) </span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Demolition Floor Plan</span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200</span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Required if remodeling an existing facility.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(6\) </span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Proposed Equipment Floor Plan</span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200</span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Equipment Schedule</span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Lists make and model of all equipment.</span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Remodels: differentiate Existing \(E\) vs New \(N\) in table format.</span></p><p style="font-size:14pt"> \200<span style="font-weight:bold"> <span style="font-weight:normal">Walk-in Units: Submit manufacturer's refrigeration sheets if applicable. </span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(7\) </span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Finish Schedule</span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200</span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Completed by area in table format.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Includes floors, walls, ceilings, and coved base finishes \(except customer waiting/dining areas\).</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Required for self-service areas \(e.g., soda dispensing\).</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Elevation drawings cannot replace a finish schedule.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(8\) </span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Elevation Drawings</span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200</span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Drawn to scale for food service areas.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(9\) </span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Storage Areas</span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Dry storage and liquor storage clearly labeled on plans and equipment schedule.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(10\) </span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Lockers/Change Rooms</span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200</span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Include proposed installation method for lockers.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(11\) </span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Electrical Plan</span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Shows electrical panel and proposed lighting.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(12\) </span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Mechanical Sheets</span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Exhaust hood drawings with elevations.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Exhaust and makeup air \(CFM\).</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Restroom ventilation.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(13\) Reflected Ceiling Plan</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200</span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Shows all ceiling attachments and structures.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Includes proposed finishes.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(14\) </span><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">Plumbing Sheets</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Water Supply Plan: hot and cold water to all fixtures.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Waste &amp; Vent Plan: sewer, drains, floor sinks/drains, grease traps/interceptors.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200Water heater details: location, installation method, energy input.</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt">\(15\) Window &amp; Door Schedule</span></p><p style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"><span style="line-height:20.93pt; font-size:14pt"> \200 Lists all proposed doors and windows with drawn details.</span></p><p style="font-size:14pt" /></body>)/Contents<>>>
endobj
