782 0 obj<</Subj(Text Box)/Type/Annot/P 5 0 R/F 4/C[]/CreationDate(D:20251203135926-08'00')/T(Ahed Saleh)/Subtype/FreeText/BS<</W 0/S/S/Type/Border>>/DA(1 0 0 rg /HelvBld 16 Tf)/DS(font: bold Helvetica 16pt; text-align:center; margin:3pt; line-height:18.4pt; color:#FF0000)/M(D:20260121172628-08'00')/AP<</N 784 0 R>>/Rect[1004.598 137.1846 1923.99 197.9846]/NM(NNBMUEZTTIVMJXYB)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" style="font:bold Helvetica 16pt; text-align:center; margin:3pt; line-height:18.4pt; color:#FF0000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="font-size:16pt; font-weight:bold">I acknowledge that submitting incomplete revised plans will result in delays and will remove the project from the queue.  I acknowledge that plans marked as a Resbumittal that are deemed to be a Change in Scope will result in the project being placed at the end of the queue for an additional 20-business day review cycle. </p></body>)/Contents(I acknowledge that submitting incomplete revised plans will result in delays and will remove the project from the queue.  I acknowledge that plans marked as a Resbumittal that are deemed to be a Change in Scope will result in the project being placed at the end of the queue for an additional 20-business day review cycle. )>>
